{
  "version": 1,
  "note": [
    "Moon-ore anomaly overlay for EVE.js v0.12.6 — data surface.",
    "",
    "Original design and the reference patch this mod reimplements are by Delta0070.",
    "See CREDITS.md. This file preserves his family/tier/composition structure verbatim;",
    "the `density` and `regionOverrides` blocks are additions, because a mod may not edit",
    "the vendor config/siteDensityRules.json the way a patch can.",
    "",
    "Each family repurposes one RETIRED client-known ore anomaly identity, so the English",
    "client renders a real site name with no client patch. These are warpable anomalies,",
    "not probe signatures, and are not tied to any specific celestial moon.",
    "",
    "`density` is per security band: a slot ceiling and an independent spawn probability",
    "per slot, matching the vendor siteDensityRules.json shape. A band omitted here gets",
    "no sites of that family at all. `regionOverrides` zeroes a family for one region",
    "outright — Pochven (10000070) is classified nullsec but shares none of its content.",
    "",
    "THE PROBABILITIES BELOW ARE NOT RESEARCHED VALUES. They are deliberately generous:",
    "this is tuned for solo/small-group progression, not retail scarcity. Retuning them",
    "is a data edit and needs no source change."
  ],
